 architecture described in the Models of [8] and apply our  training data to generate the classification of 26 Letters. Our goal is to map images from a particular  domain to a Letter that it means. We will be finetuning (transfer learning) existing models that  perform classification on RGB images. We will Look at the levels of RGB images in Particular  Centroidal Pixels and We can Classify from the Centre Which Shape is Defined. We are Planing to  Use RESNET - Residual Neural Networks or Similar to be able to argue and analyze the better  Accuracy between all of the Networks. ","topics":[],"score":216799,"global_rank":237667},{"name":"aishwarya34/MachineLearningModels","owner":"aishwarya34","html_url":"https://github.com/aishwarya34/MachineLearningModels","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Machine Learning Models built using different machine learning and deep learning frameworks ","topics":["cnn","computer-vision","deep-learning","keras","machine-learning","opencv","pandas","python","scikit-learn","tensorflow"],"score":216797,"global_rank":237688},{"name":"akritibhat/Boston-Crime-Prediction-DMT","owner":"akritibhat","html_url":"https://github.com/akritibhat/Boston-Crime-Prediction-DMT","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216797,"global_rank":237689},{"name":"JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","owner":"JY1148","html_url":"https://github.com/JY1148/my-dumbbell-curls-coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216790,"global_rank":237703},{"name":"HusainZafar/spambase","owner":"HusainZafar","html_url":"https://github.com/HusainZafar/spambase","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Classifying Email as Spam or Non-Spam","topics":["jupyter-notebook","spam-detection"],"score":216783,"global_rank":237744},{"name":"amarbu